WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.100
Gemini key (required)

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.100
Go to aistudio.google.com with your Google account

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.100
Click “Get API key” (top left or in the menu)

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.100
Click “Create API key” and choose a project, or let a new one be created

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.100
Copy the key, which starts with “A”

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.100
Paste it in the “Set up my thesis” form in your sheet

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.100
OpenAlex key (required)

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.100
Go to openalex.org and click “Sign in” or “Sign up” to create a free account

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.100
Open your profile or account settings

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.100
Find the API key section and copy the value

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.100
Paste it in the “Set up my thesis” form

